==Trivia==
*The text on Malevolent Jamiera Cat's shirt is ピザ (''pizza'' written in katakana) flipped vertically and horizontally.
*Malevolent Jamiera Cat is the first character to have a Savage Blow damage multiplier other than 3x, the second being [[Possessed Silver Nyanko Ranger]].
**Incidentally, both of them have a 6x damage multiplier.

